-- check/bad: `()` under a constructor is a real alternative of a real
-- union, not a wildcard — so naming `Just ()` covers `Just` and leaves
-- `Nothing` missing, and the counterexample has to be `Nothing` alone.
-- The guard that the fix for the nested-`()` defect did not over-correct
-- into "a unit argument makes the whole column complete" (checker.md §6).
pub only : Maybe ⊤ → Int
only m =
    case m of
        Just ⊤ →
            1
